{
  "_comment": [
    "Bounty definitions served in GET /bounty/game-data as bounty_data.",
    "",
    "The gameserver validates every stored bounty against this list on login:",
    "a bounty whose id is absent is treated as 'disabled from config', and",
    "UBountyComponent::ServerInitializeBounties resets it and refunds the token.",
    "With this list empty, every drafted bounty was wiped on every relog.",
    "",
    "Ids are the row names of the client's own Gameplay/Bounty/bounty_table,",
    "so they are exactly the bounties this build can display.",
    "",
    "reward_amount is Hunt Pass XP and is a server-owner choice, not something",
    "recovered from the original service. Defaults here are tiered by rarity.",
    "1.4.4 entry serializer at preferred VA 0x1413f2d20 reads bounty_id, enabled, reward_amount.",
    "enabled must be explicit; missing it disables the entry and prevents drafting.",
    "on_claim_grant_item_* fields belong to the separate item_grant_data entry serializer (0x1413f2f40)."
  ],
